r\n  produces immunospecific antibodies, to counteract the effect of corresponding\r\n  antigens. On the other hand the paratyphoid fever caused by Salmonella\r\n  paratyphi A or Salmonella paratyphi B is characterized by milder causes of\r\n  disease. These organism is also possess somatic \u2018O\u2019 and fagellar antigen\r\n  which is termed as A(H) and B(H) respectively. The other organisms of\r\n  Salmonella species like Salmonella typhimurium responsible for causing food\r\n  poisoning or Arizona group causing fetal infection do have similar antigenic\r\n  properties.<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td style='border:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm' width=3><p class='MsoNormal'>&nbsp;<\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr height=0>\r\n  <td width=185 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=67 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=14 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=53 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=67 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=67 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=72 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=164 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=3 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 align=left\r\n width=680 style='border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:6.75pt;margin-right:\r\n 6.75pt'>\r\n <tr style='height:9.0pt'>\r\n  <td width=144 valign=top style='width:108.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:9.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0 MFD BY<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=25 valign=top style='width:18.7pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:9.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=511 valign=top style='width:383.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:9.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=M